  "content": "<html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"flex min-h-dvh\">\n   <a href=\"#main\" class=\"sr-only focus:not-sr-only focus:fixed focus:left-3 focus:top-3 focus:z-[70] focus:rounded-control focus:bg-surface focus:px-3 focus:py-2\">跳到正文</a>\n   <main id=\"main\" class=\"min-w-0 flex-1 pb-[calc(72px+env(safe-area-inset-bottom))] lg:px-7 lg:pb-[72px] lg:pt-6\">\n    <div class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-[640px] pl-[var(--gutter-l)] pr-[var(--gutter-r)] lg:max-w-[var(--page-max-wide)] lg:px-0\">\n     <div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[var(--page-max-reading)] gap-8 pb-14 pt-5 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_300px] lg:gap-10 lg:pt-0 2xl:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_340px]\">\n      <div class=\"min-w-0\">\n       <div class=\"mt-6 flex flex-col gap-2 rounded-card border border-amber/30 bg-amber-soft px-4 py-3 text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-ink-2 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between\">\n        <span class=\"flex gap-2\"><span><b class=\"font-semibold text-ink\">旧接口和旧域名 <!-- -->2026 年 10 月 31 日<!-- -->一起停用</b>　/api/public/* 请换到 /api/v1，字段一一对应；地址里还是 aihot.virxact.com 的 RSS、MCP、API，请换成 aihot.news，之后旧域名只做跳转。</span></span><a href=\"https://aihot.news/agent?tab=api#legacy-api-migration\" class=\"shrink-0 self-start whitespace-nowrap rounded-full border border-amber/35 bg-surface px-3 py-1 text-[12.5px] font-medium text-amber-ink transition-colors hover:border-amber sm:self-auto\">迁移指南 →</a>\n       </div>\n       <p class=\"mt-3 text-[12.5px] leading-[1.7] text-ink-4\">下面复制出去的配置里带一个本机生成的匿名标识，只用来合并统计，不是账号或密钥，清除浏览器数据后会换新。详见<a class=\"text-accent hover:underline\" href=\"https://aihot.news/privacy\" data-discover=\"true\">隐私说明</a>。</p>\n       <section id=\"agent-panel\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"agent-tab-rss\" class=\"mt-9\">\n        <div class=\"mt-6 gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2\">\n         <div class=\"card flex flex-col p-4\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n           <span class=\"text-[15px] font-semibold text-ink\">精选摘要</span><span class=\"inline-flex h-[18px] items-center rounded-full bg-accent-soft px-2 text-[11px] font-medium text-accent\">推荐</span>\n          </div>\n          <p class=\"mt-1 flex-1 text-[13px] leading-[1.7] text-ink-3\">最新 50 条精选，带标题、摘要、站内阅读和原文链接。</p>\n          <div class=\"mt-3 flex items-center gap-2 border-t border-line-soft pt-3\">\n           <code class=\"mono min-w-0 flex-1 truncate text-[12px] text-ink-4\">https://aihot.news<!-- -->/feed.xml</code>\n           <button type=\"button\" class=\"inline-flex h-7 items-center gap-1 rounded-mark border border-line bg-surface px-2 text-[12px] transition-colors text-ink-3 hover:border-line-strong hover:text-ink shrink-0\" aria-label=\"复制地址\"><span></span>复制地址</button>\n          </div>\n         </div>\n         <div class=\"card flex flex-col p-4\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n           <span class=\"text-[15px] font-semibold text-ink\">精选全文</span>\n          </div>\n          <p class=\"mt-1 flex-1 text-[13px] leading-[1.7] text-ink-3\">同样的 50 条；允许转载的来源直接附全文，其余仍是摘要。</p>\n          <div class=\"mt-3 flex items-center gap-2 border-t border-line-soft pt-3\">\n           <code class=\"mono min-w-0 flex-1 truncate text-[12px] text-ink-4\">https://aihot.news<!-- -->/feed/full.xml</code>\n           <button type=\"button\" class=\"inline-flex h-7 items-center gap-1 rounded-mark border border-line bg-surface px-2 text-[12px] transition-colors text-ink-3 hover:border-line-strong hover:text-ink shrink-0\" aria-label=\"复制地址\"><span></span>复制地址</button>\n          </div>\n         </div>\n         <div class=\"card flex flex-col p-4\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n           <span class=\"text-[15px] font-semibold text-ink\">全部动态</span>\n          </div>\n          <p class=\"mt-1 flex-1 text-[13px] leading-[1.7] text-ink-3\">最近 7 天的公开动态，按原文发布时间倒序。</p>\n          <div class=\"mt-3 flex items-center gap-2 border-t border-line-soft pt-3\">\n           <code class=\"mono min-w-0 flex-1 truncate text-[12px] text-ink-4\">https://aihot.news<!-- -->/feed/all.xml</code>\n           <button type=\"button\" class=\"inline-flex h-7 items-center gap-1 rounded-mark border border-line bg-surface px-2 text-[12px] transition-colors text-ink-3 hover:border-line-strong hover:text-ink shrink-0\" aria-label=\"复制地址\"><span></span>复制地址</button>\n          </div>\n         </div>\n         <div class=\"card flex flex-col p-4\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n           <span class=\"text-[15px] font-semibold text-ink\">AI 日报</span>\n          </div>\n          <p class=\"mt-1 flex-1 text-[13px] leading-[1.7] text-ink-3\">每天 08:00（北京时间）一期：头条导语加整期目录，保留最近 30 期。</p>\n          <div class=\"mt-3 flex items-center gap-2 border-t border-line-soft pt-3\">\n           <code class=\"mono min-w-0 flex-1 truncate text-[12px] text-ink-4\">https://aihot.news<!-- -->/feed/daily.xml</code>\n           <button type=\"button\" class=\"inline-flex h-7 items-center gap-1 rounded-mark border border-line bg-surface px-2 text-[12px] transition-colors text-ink-3 hover:border-line-strong hover:text-ink shrink-0\" aria-label=\"复制地址\"><span></span>复制地址</button>\n          </div>\n         </div>\n         <div class=\"card flex flex-col p-4\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n           <span class=\"text-[15px] font-semibold text-ink\">AI 周报</span>\n          </div>\n          <p class=\"mt-1 flex-1 text-[13px] leading-[1.7] text-ink-3\">每周一 10:00（北京时间）一期：总述加按栏目分好的大事，保留最近 12 期。</p>\n          <div class=\"mt-3 flex items-center gap-2 border-t border-line-soft pt-3\">\n           <code class=\"mono min-w-0 flex-1 truncate text-[12px] text-ink-4\">https://aihot.news<!-- -->/feed/weekly.xml</code>\n           <button type=\"button\" class=\"inline-flex h-7 items-center gap-1 rounded-mark border border-line bg-surface px-2 text-[12px] transition-colors text-ink-3 hover:border-line-strong hover:text-ink shrink-0\" aria-label=\"复制地址\"><span></span>复制地址</button>\n          </div>\n         </div>\n         <div class=\"card flex flex-col p-4\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n           <span class=\"text-[15px] font-semibold text-ink\">AI 月报</span>\n          </div>\n          <p class=\"mt-1 flex-1 text-[13px] leading-[1.7] text-ink-3\">每月 1 日 10:30（北京时间）一期：总述加按栏目分好的大事，保留最近 12 期。</p>\n          <div class=\"mt-3 flex items-center gap-2 border-t border-line-soft pt-3\">\n           <code class=\"mono min-w-0 flex-1 truncate text-[12px] text-ink-4\">https://aihot.news<!-- -->/feed/monthly.xml</code>\n           <button type=\"button\" class=\"inline-flex h-7 items-center gap-1 rounded-mark border border-line bg-surface px-2 text-[12px] transition-colors text-ink-3 hover:border-line-strong hover:text-ink shrink-0\" aria-label=\"复制地址\"><span></span>复制地址</button>\n          </div>\n         </div>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"mt-3 text-[12.5px] text-ink-4\">复制出去的地址末尾带本机的匿名标识 aihot_actor，删掉也能订阅。</p>\n        <section class=\"mt-10 scroll-mt-24 border-t border-line pt-6\">\n         <h3 class=\"mb-3 text-[16px] font-semibold text-ink\">按分类订阅</h3>\n         <div class=\"text-[14px] leading-[1.8] text-ink-2\">\n          <div class=\"overflow-x-auto rounded-card border border-line bg-surface\">\n           <table class=\"w-full text-left text-[13.5px]\" style=\"min-width:420px\">\n            <thead class=\"bg-bg-sunk text-[12.5px] text-ink-3\">\n             <tr>\n              <th class=\"px-3.5 py-2 font-medium\">分类</th>\n              <th class=\"px-3.5 py-2 font-medium\">摘要</th>\n              <th class=\"px-3.5 py-2 font-medium\">全文</th>\n             </tr>\n            </thead>\n            <tbody>\n             <tr class=\"border-t border-line-soft align-top\">\n              <td class=\"px-3.5 py-2.5\"><span class=\"font-medium text-ink\">AI 模型</span></td>\n              <td class=\"px-3.5 py-2.5\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2\"><code class=\"mono rounded-mark bg-bg-sunk px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[0.88em] text-ink\">/feed/category/ai-models.xml</code> \n                <button type=\"button\" class=\"inline-flex h-7 items-center gap-1 rounded-mark border border-line bg-surface px-2 text-[12px] transition-colors text-ink-3 hover:border-line-strong hover:text-ink !h-6 !px-1.5\" aria-label=\"复制\"><span></span>复制</button></span></td>\n              <td class=\"px-3.5 py-2.5\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2\"><code class=\"mono rounded-mark bg-bg-sunk px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[0.88em] text-ink\">/feed/full/category/ai-models.xml</code> \n                <button type=\"button\" class=\"inline-flex h-7 items-center gap-1 rounded-mark border border-line bg-surface px-2 text-[12px] transition-colors text-ink-3 hover:border-line-strong hover:text-ink !h-6 !px-1.5\" aria-label=\"复制\"><span></span>复制</button></span></td>\n             </tr>\n             <tr class=\"border-t border-line-soft align-top\">\n              <td class=\"px-3.5 py-2.5\"><span class=\"font-medium text-ink\">AI 产品</span></td>\n              <td class=\"px-3.5 py-2.5\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2\"><code class=\"mono rounded-mark bg-bg-sunk px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[0.88em] text-ink\">/feed/category/ai-products.xml</code> \n                <button type=\"button\" class=\"inline-flex h-7 items-center gap-1 rounded-mark border border-line bg-surface px-2 text-[12px] transition-colors text-ink-3 hover:border-line-strong hover:text-ink !h-6 !px-1.5\" aria-label=\"复制\"><span></span>复制</button></span></td>\n              <td class=\"px-3.5 py-2.5\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2\"><code class=\"mono rounded-mark bg-bg-sunk px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[0.88em] text-ink\">/feed/full/category/ai-products.xml</code> \n                <button type=\"button\" class=\"inline-flex h-7 items-center gap-1 rounded-mark border border-line bg-surface px-2 text-[12px] transition-colors text-ink-3 hover:border-line-strong hover:text-ink !h-6 !px-1.5\" aria-label=\"复制\"><span></span>复制</button></span></td>\n             </tr>\n             <tr class=\"border-t border-line-soft align-top\">\n              <td class=\"px-3.5 py-2.5\"><span class=\"font-medium text-ink\">行业动态</span></td>\n              <td class=\"px-3.5 py-2.5\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2\"><code class=\"mono rounded-mark bg-bg-sunk px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[0.88em] text-ink\">/feed/category/industry.xml</code> \n                <button type=\"button\" class=\"inline-flex h-7 items-center gap-1 rounded-mark border border-line bg-surface px-2 text-[12px] transition-colors text-ink-3 hover:border-line-strong hover:text-ink !h-6 !px-1.5\" aria-label=\"复制\"><span></span>复制</button></span></td>\n              <td class=\"px-3.5 py-2.5\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2\"><code class=\"mono rounded-mark bg-bg-sunk px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[0.88em] text-ink\">/feed/full/category/industry.xml</code> \n                <button type=\"button\" class=\"inline-flex h-7 items-center gap-1 rounded-mark border border-line bg-surface px-2 text-[12px] transition-colors text-ink-3 hover:border-line-strong hover:text-ink !h-6 !px-1.5\" aria-label=\"复制\"><span></span>复制</button></span></td>\n             </tr>\n             <tr class=\"border-t border-line-soft align-top\">\n              <td class=\"px-3.5 py-2.5\"><span class=\"font-medium text-ink\">论文</span></td>\n              <td class=\"px-3.5 py-2.5\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2\"><code class=\"mono rounded-mark bg-bg-sunk px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[0.88em] text-ink\">/feed/category/paper.xml</code> \n                <button type=\"button\" class=\"inline-flex h-7 items-center gap-1 rounded-mark border border-line bg-surface px-2 text-[12px] transition-colors text-ink-3 hover:border-line-strong hover:text-ink !h-6 !px-1.5\" aria-label=\"复制\"><span></span>复制</button></span></td>\n              <td class=\"px-3.5 py-2.5\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2\"><code class=\"mono rounded-mark bg-bg-sunk px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[0.88em] text-ink\">/feed/full/category/paper.xml</code> \n                <button type=\"button\" class=\"inline-flex h-7 items-center gap-1 rounded-mark border border-line bg-surface px-2 text-[12px] transition-colors text-ink-3 hover:border-line-strong hover:text-ink !h-6 !px-1.5\" aria-label=\"复制\"><span></span>复制</button></span></td>\n             </tr>\n             <tr class=\"border-t border-line-soft align-top\">\n              <td class=\"px-3.5 py-2.5\"><span class=\"font-medium text-ink\">技巧观点</span></td>\n              <td class=\"px-3.5 py-2.5\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2\"><code class=\"mono rounded-mark bg-bg-sunk px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[0.88em] text-ink\">/feed/category/tip.xml</code> \n                <button type=\"button\" class=\"inline-flex h-7 items-center gap-1 rounded-mark border border-line bg-surface px-2 text-[12px] transition-colors text-ink-3 hover:border-line-strong hover:text-ink !h-6 !px-1.5\" aria-label=\"复制\"><span></span>复制</button></span></td>\n              <td class=\"px-3.5 py-2.5\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2\"><code class=\"mono rounded-mark bg-bg-sunk px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[0.88em] text-ink\">/feed/full/category/tip.xml</code> \n                <button type=\"button\" class=\"inline-flex h-7 items-center gap-1 rounded-mark border border-line bg-surface px-2 text-[12px] transition-colors text-ink-3 hover:border-line-strong hover:text-ink !h-6 !px-1.5\" aria-label=\"复制\"><span></span>复制</button></span></td>\n             </tr>\n            </tbody>\n           </table>\n          </div>\n         </div>\n        </section>\n        <section class=\"mt-10 scroll-mt-24 border-t border-line pt-6\">\n         <h3 class=\"mb-3 text-[16px] font-semibold text-ink\">刷新多快合适</h3>\n         <div class=\"text-[14px] leading-[1.8] text-ink-2\">\n          <p>阅读器会带着上次的 ETag 来问，内容没变时只回一个很小的 304，不重复下载。30 分钟刷新一次就够，更快也拿不到新的内容。</p>\n          <p class=\"mt-3 text-[13px] text-ink-3\">条目链接指向站内阅读页，原文链接在摘要里。能匿名订阅不等于所有用途都获许可：对外产品、公开副本或批量转载须先取得书面授权，见<a class=\"text-accent hover:underline\" href=\"https://aihot.news/terms\" data-discover=\"true\">公开使用规则</a>。</p>\n         </div>\n        </section>\n       </section>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </main>\n  </div>\n  <!--$?-->\n  <template id=\"B:0\"></template>\n  <!--/$-->\n </body>\n</html>",
  "aiSummary": "本文为接入 AIHOT 的 Agent 相关 RSS、MCP 和 API 服务提供了技术指南和接入方案。",
  "oneSentenceSummary": "本文为接入 AIHOT 的 Agent 相关 RSS、MCP 和 API 服务提供了技术指南和接入方案。",
  "summary": "本文内容概述了针对 AIHOT 开发者的关键技术更新，宣布旧版 API 端点 (/api/public/) 和旧域名将于 2026 年 10 月 31 日废弃。文中引导用户迁移至 /api/v1 格式和新域名。文章还详细介绍了包括 RSS、日报、周报和月报在内的多种订阅方法。此外，还说明了关于匿名标识的隐私政策，并规定了内容分发与使用的条款。",
  "mainPoints": [
    {
      "point": "旧版 API 废弃",
      "explanation": "用户必须在 2026 年 10 月 31 日之前从 /api/public/* 切换到 /api/v1，并将域名从 aihot.virxact.com 更新为 aihot.news。"
    },
    {
      "point": "灵活的接入方案",
      "explanation": "服务提供多种频率的选择，包括日报、周报、月报以及针对特定类别（模型、产品、行业）的 RSS 流。"
    },
    {
      "point": "隐私与数据使用",
      "explanation": "配置中包含的匿名本地标识符用于合并统计数据，不作为账户密钥，且会随浏览器数据而重置。"
    }
